message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Benchmark-Based Spatial Accessibility Metric: Minimum Attainment Cost (MAC)"
abstract: >
  A toolkit for computing transportation accessibility from an
  origin-destination travel-time matrix, centered on Minimum Attainment
  Cost (MAC) -- benchmark-based accessibility measure -- alongside
  shortest path and cumulative opportunity accessibility.
